    <!-- First-launch guide -->
    <string name="guide_title">Before you start</string>
    <string name="guide_1">Experimental, unofficial software with no automotive safety certification. It does not replace the factory dashcam, reversing camera or blind-spot monitor. Do not operate it while driving.</string>
    <string name="guide_2">Insert a USB drive before recording. Without one, recording will not start: a dashcam writes continuously, and the head unit\'s internal flash has a limited write endurance and usually cannot be replaced.</string>
    <string name="guide_3">The super mirror is off by default — turn it on under Settings → Super mirror. In its middle third, swipe up/down to reframe and left/right to change lane; drag either side to move the window.</string>
    <string name="guide_4">If something misbehaves, restart the app first. If it persists, export the details from Settings → About → Diagnostics.</string>
    <string name="action_got_it_guide">Got it</string>

